 kely Democrats in key swing states to win key elections in 2026! We love f
 ree texting! We call it Text on Tap\, and it's the new and improved versio
 n of BYOP. It uses an anonymized Google Voice number. It's a great way to 
 register new Democrats! There are a few things you'll need to set up on yo
 ur computer but they aren't difficult\, and we provide all the trainin
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/ft6/event/405150/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
