BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Get Out the Vote with Magali Limeta!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T130000
UID:e4833caf277b80eb1a2408e9096809ea@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/CA%20GOTV%20Events%20%281200%20x%20630%20px%29%20%2822%29_202
 60429210459759265.png
DESCRIPTION:Novato's very own Magali Limeta is the Working Families Party 
 choice to represent us as the Marin County Supervisor of District 5! We de
 serve a champion that will ensure that housing is affordable for seniors a
 nd working families\, protect us against climate change and fight to make 
 sure health care is accessible for all. Come walk with us on Saturdays & S
 undays to elect Magali for supervisor!! What you need: - comfortable walki
 ng shoes - a hat - an easy-to-carry water bottle
LOCATION:Miwok Park\, 2200 Novato Blvd\, Novato\, CA\, 94947
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/ca-wfp/event/954986/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Get Out the Vote with Magali Limeta!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T100000
