 serve a champion that will ensure that housing is affordable for seniors a
 nd working families\, protect us against climate change and fight to make 
 sure health care is accessible for all. Come walk with us on Saturdays & S
 undays to elect Magali for supervisor!! What you need: - comfortable walki
