DESCRIPTION:Spend a fun afternoon with friends in a beautiful garden and e
 njoy wine\, appetizers and a lively band as we support Representative Step
 hanie Simacek\, running for reelection for Arizona State House in LD 2! Jo
 in us for fabulous wines\, craft beers\, sangria and a delicious array of 
 appetizers. Music provided by Memory Lane Combo. Limited seating\, RSVP an
 d donate early! Suggested donation: $50-$85 per person at https://bit.ly/S
 teph_Wine. Silent auction items include vacation stays in San Francisco\, 
LOCATION:Forestville\, CA
